libwebp 1.6.0, decoder-only scalar C sources, unchanged upstream.
Source: https://storage.googleapis.com/downloads.webmproject.org/releases/webp/libwebp-1.6.0.tar.gz
Archive SHA256: e4ab7009bf0629fd11982d4c2aa83964cf244cffba7347ecd39019a9e38c4564
Includes src/dec/*.c and decoder COMMON_SOURCES from src/{dsp,utils}/Makefile.am.
Banana additions: src/webp/config.h and libc/. No encoder API is exposed; common upstream palette helpers are retained.
No SIMD, pthreads or file I/O.
Allocation shims check size_t before forwarding to the kernel heap (allocations capped at UINT32_MAX).
COPYING, PATENTS and AUTHORS are upstream notices.
